  "question": "Where’s the closest fast food restaurant found toward the northwest of the Whitley, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Atlanta Buckhead, Atlanta, GA?",
  "sql": "SELECT p.poi_name, p.addr_state, p.addr_city FROM pois AS p WHERE p.amenity = 'fast_food' AND degrees(ST_Azimuth( (SELECT geometry FROM pois WHERE poi_name ILIKE '%The Whitley, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Atlanta Buckhead%' LIMIT 1), p.geometry )) BETWEEN 292.5 AND 337.5 -- Northwest direction ORDER BY ST_Distance( (SELECT geometry FROM pois WHERE poi_name ILIKE '%The Whitley, a Luxury Collection Hotel, Atlanta Buckhead%' LIMIT 1)::geography, p.geometry::geography ) ASC LIMIT 1;",
